## Interface: 120100
## Title: |cff66ccffOneClick|rFish
## Notes: One key casts Fishing and loots the bobber. Pole equipped from your bags, instant loot, quieter music while the line is out, and a session HUD: catches, value, gold per hour.
## Notes-zhTW: 一個按鍵拋竿與收竿。自動裝備魚竿、秒拾取、拋竿時壓低音樂，還有顯示漁獲、價值與每小時收益的 HUD。
